# uploaded textbook page scans - personal copyrighted material, stays local
# only, never pushed to GitHub even though this repo is currently private.
# Lives outside public/ now (see UPLOADS_DIR) since public/ is baked in at
# build time and doesn't survive redeploys on Railway/Vercel.
/uploads/*
!/uploads/.gitkeep
public/uploads/*
!public/uploads/.gitkeep

